kpify borrows ideas, not code or text, from the projects below. A comparison of kpify's files
against their repositories found no shared passages beyond generic boilerplate. They are credited
because their approaches shaped the design.

- obra/superpowers (MIT) — https://github.com/obra/superpowers
  An entry skill that routes to the right process, skills written as rigid procedures with
  red-flag tables, and baseline-first skill testing (run the scenario without the skill first).

- pbakaus/impeccable (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
  One command vocabulary for a domain, backed by shared reference files, with deterministic
  checks alongside model critique.

- morluto/rea (MIT) — https://github.com/morluto/rea
  Evidence-first investigation: every claim points at an observation.

Optional integration: Archify (https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify) is only suggested for rendering
schema diagrams; nothing from it is bundled.

The Northwind Coffee scenario data is synthetic and fictional.
